  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Doctor Kunj installed new software on cyborg Shresth.\r\nThis software introduced Shresth to range minimum queries.\n\nCyborg Shresth thought of TTT different problems in each of which you will be given\r\nan array AAA of length NNN and an array BBB of length MMM. In each of these problems, you have to calculate:\n\n∑i=1m∑j=imrangeMin(B[i],B[j])\\sum_{i=1}^m \\sum_{j=i}^m rangeMin(B[i],B[j])∑i=1m​∑j=im​rangeMin(B[i],B[j])\n\nWhere rangeMin(i,j)rangeMin(i,j)rangeMin(i,j) returns the minimum element in the range of indices iii to jjj (both included) in array AAA.\n\nIt is given that array BBB consists of pairwise distinct elements and is in ascending order.\n\n###Input Format:\n\n\nFirst line will contain TTT, the number of different problems Cyborg Shresth thought of.\nEach problem's input data will be given in three different lines.\nThe first line will contain NNN and MMM, the length of array AAA and BBB respectively.\nThe second line will contain NNN space separated positive integers, which form the array AAA. -\nThe third line will contain MMM space separated positive integers, which form the array BBB.\n###Output Format:\n\n\nFor each different problem, print on a new line the answer to the problem, i.e. the value of ∑i=1m∑j=imrangeMin(B[i],B[j])\\sum_{i=1}^m \\sum_{j=i}^m rangeMin(B[i],B[j])∑i=1m​∑j=im​rangeMin(B[i],B[j]) .",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq {10}^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq {10}^51≤N≤105",
      "1≤M≤1051 \\leq M \\leq {10}^51≤M≤105",
      "1≤A[i]≤1091 \\leq A[i] \\leq 10^91≤A[i]≤109",
      "1≤B[i]≤N1 \\leq B[i] \\leq N1≤B[i]≤N",
      "It is guaranteed that the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 106{10}^6106 .",
      "Sample Input:`1",
      "7 3",
      "10 3 7 9 1 19 2",
      "1 4 6",
      "`Sample Output:`43",
      "`###Explanation:",
      "For the given array AAA, we have to calculate rangeMin(1,1)+rangeMin(1,4)+rangeMin(1,6)+rangeMin(4,4)+rangeMin(4,6)+rangeMin(6,6)rangeMin(1,1) + rangeMin(1,4) + rangeMin(1,6) + rangeMin(4,4) + rangeMin(4,6) + rangeMin(6,6) rangeMin(1,1)+rangeMin(1,4)+rangeMin(1,6)+rangeMin(4,4)+rangeMin(4,6)+rangeMin(6,6).",
      "This is equal to 10+3+1+9+1+19=4310 + 3 + 1 + 9 + 1 +19 = 4310+3+1+9+1+19=43."
    ],
